# Zervox Environment Variables
#
# Zervox works without any configuration out of the box.
# Set OPENAI_API_KEY only if you want AI-powered crash diagnostics.

# AI Diagnostics (optional)
# Set this to enable GPT-based root cause analysis in the dashboard.
# Without it, Zervox uses fast built-in pattern matching.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Dashboard port (optional, default: 3000)
# ZERVOX_PORT=3000
